{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792459620, "covers_from": "2026-10-20T01:27:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-20T01:28:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792459680, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-20T01:27:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 67939, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "我想問為什麼他們一直說有松機就不能都更？都更只有一種方式嗎，世界上那麼多機場為什麼松機就不行", "display_name": "松山代表 No.67,939", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T01:27:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53598, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你擔任市長，勞工退休金（純舊制）未依據勞基法辦理，勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.53,598", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T01:27:26+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 27488, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "觀光", "content": "期待發展河岸觀光文創商圈", "display_name": "北投代表 No.27,488", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T01:27:31+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 1963, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "教育", "content": "我是一位老師，也是有女兒的媽媽，\n每天看見同學因為營養午餐難只吃兩口，\n真的很心疼孩子們！", "display_name": "北投代表 Mimi（Milena)", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T01:27:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 64024, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "環境", "content": "市長好，我們家附近的公車站牌旁的垃圾桶都不見了，對面恐龍公園的垃圾桶也不見了，真的非常不方便！", "display_name": "北投代表 許瑋芬 Betty Hsu", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 53598, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.53,598", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 27488, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.27,488", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "f